{
  "id": "TN-SB-150-2009",
  "scope": "state:tn",
  "title": "SB 150 (106th General Assembly): As introduced, requires a voter to present qualified photographic identification before voting; voters without proper identification shall be allowed to cast provisional ballots. - Amends TCA Title 2, Chapter 7, Part 1.",
  "urls": [
    "https://legiscan.com/TN/bill/SB0150/2009",
